.#-----------------------------------------------------
.input|xhtml/1.0
.# A paragraph located after some content in a list item or a definition description doesn't need a div, while a
.# paragraph that is the first content of the list item, or a Group with parameters, still does
.#-----------------------------------------------------
<html><body><ul><li>a<p>b</p></li><li><p>c</p></li><li>d<div class="x"><p>e</p></div></li></ul></body></html>
.#-----------------------------------------------------
.expect|markdown/1.2
.#-----------------------------------------------------
* a

  b
* <div>

  c

  </div>
* d

  <div class="x">

  e

  </div>
